Consequently, awarded 30% solatium on the enhanced market value fixed as provided under Section 23(2) of the Act;
additional market value @ 12% per annum on such market value from the date of Sec.4(1) Notification of the Act till the date of Award; also awarded interest at 12% per annum for one year from the date of taking possession thereafter at 15% per annum till the date of payment on enhanced market value and also entitled to interest on additional market value and solatium.
